-LIST LINKS</h2><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Each link shows the page with its own adjustment, e.g. a VIP list at +0% or a trade-show list at +8%. Send the link; the browser remembers it.</div><form data-form=\"plist\" style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjPlLabel\" placeholder=\"Label (e.g. JIS show)\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:120px\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjPlCode\" placeholder=\"code (optional)\" style=\"width:130px\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjPlPct\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.5\" placeholder=\"% adj.\" style=\"width:90px\"><button class=\"b\" type=\"submit\">CREATE LINK</button></form>' +\n      (p.lists.length ? '<table style=\"margin-top:8px\">' + p.lists.map(function (l) { return '<tr><td><b style=\"color:#261d3d\">' + esc(l.label || l.code) + '</b><br><span class=\"muted\">' + (l.markupPct >= 0 ? '+' : '') + l.markupPct + '%</span></td><td><input class=\"in\" readonly value=\"' + esc(l.url || ('?list=' + l.code)) + '\" style=\"width:100%;font-size:11px\"></td><td><button class=\"b\" data-pldel=\"' + esc(l.code) + '\">REMOVE</button></td></tr>'; }).join('') + '</table>' : '') + '</div>';\n    h += '<div class=\"card\"><h2>ONE-OFF PRICE OVERRIDES</h2><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Set a specific price for a specific stone (wins over the sheet price and the % adjustment).</div><form data-form=\"override\" style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjOvId\" placeholder=\"Stock #\" style=\"width:150px\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjOvP\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" placeholder=\"Price $ (blank = remove)\" style=\"width:170px\"><button class=\"b pri\" type=\"submit\">SET</button>' + (p.overrides.length ? '<button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-a=\"ovclear\">CLEAR ALL</button>' : '') + '</form>' +\n      (p.overrides.length ? '<div class=\"tw\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><table><tr><th>STOCK #</th><th>SHEET</th><th>NOW</th><th></th></tr>' + p.overrides.map(function (x) { return '<tr><td><b style=\"color:#261d3d\">' + esc(x.id) + '</b>' + (x.known ? '' : ' <span style=\"color:#C8554F\">not in inventory</span>') + '</td><td>' + (x.base != null ? $(x.base) : '\u2014') + '</td><td><b>' + $(x.price) + '</b></td><td><button class=\"b\" data-ovdel=\"' + esc(x.id) + '\">REMOVE</button></td></tr>'; }).join('') + '</table></div>' : '<div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">None.</div>') + '</div>';\n    h += '<div class=\"card\" style=\"grid-column:1/-1\"><h2>BUYING GROUPS (RJO \u00b7 NIJA \u00b7 \u2026)</h2><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Buyers pick their group in the order form and enter their member number. The order shows the member quote; you VERIFY it on the order (Orders \u2192 open \u2192 Membership) and the discount is confirmed. Promoted / sale stones never get the member discount. Memo terms are not offered on the site.</div>' +\n      '<form data-form=\"programs\"><div class=\"tw\"><table id=\"sjProgT\"><tr><th>CODE</th><th>LABEL SHOWN</th><th>% OFF LOOSE</th><th>EXTRA % OVER $</th><th>EXTRA % OVER $</th><th>SHIPPING $</th><th>NOTE</th><th></th></tr>' + Object.keys(s.programs || {}).map(function (k) { var pr = s.programs[k]; var t1 = (pr.tiers || [])[0] || ['', ''], t2 = (pr.tiers || [])[1] || ['', '']; return '<tr data-prog=\"' + esc(k) + '\"><td><b style=\"color:#261d3d\">' + esc(k) + '</b></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-pf=\"label\" value=\"' + esc(pr.label) + '\" style=\"width:140px\"></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-pf=\"pct\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"' + pr.pct + '\" style=\"width:70px\"></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-pf=\"t1a\" type=\"number\" value=\"' + esc(t1[0]) + '\" placeholder=\"10000\" style=\"width:90px\"> \u2192 <input class=\"in\" data-pf=\"t1p\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"' + esc(t1[1]) + '\" placeholder=\"0.5\" style=\"width:60px\">%</td><td><input class=\"in\" data-pf=\"t2a\" type=\"number\" value=\"' + esc(t2[0]) + '\" placeholder=\"50000\" style=\"width:90px\"> \u2192 <input class=\"in\" data-pf=\"t2p\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"' + esc(t2[1]) + '\" placeholder=\"1\" style=\"width:60px\">%</td><td><input class=\"in\" data-pf=\"shipping\" type=\"number\" value=\"' + (pr.shipping == null ? '' : pr.shipping) + '\" placeholder=\"' + (s.shippingFee == null ? 45 : s.shippingFee) + '\" style=\"width:70px\"></td><td><input class=\"in\" data-pf=\"note\" value=\"' + esc(pr.note || '') + '\" style=\"width:160px\"></td><td><button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-progdel=\"' + esc(k) + '\">REMOVE</button></td></tr>'; }).join('') + '</table></div>' +\n      '<div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;align-items:center\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjProgNew\" placeholder=\"New code (e.g. NIJA)\" style=\"width:160px\"><button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-a=\"progadd\">ADD GROUP</button><span class=\"sp\"></span><label style=\"font-size:12px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sjPickup\" ' + (s.pickup ? 'checked' : '') + '> Offer free pick-up at the LA office</label><button class=\"b pri\" type=\"submit\">SAVE GROUPS</button></div></form></div>';\n    h += '<div class=\"card\" style=\"grid-column:1/-1\"><h2>BUNDLE DEALS \u00b7 N STONES FOR ONE PRICE</h2><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Every stone in a bundle gets a \u201cBUNDLE \u00b7 name \u00b7 N stones for $X\u201d button on the page; one tap adds all of them to the buyer\u2019s bag with a note. If a stone sells on its own the bundle shows as PARTIAL until you edit it.</div>' +\n      '<form data-form=\"bundle\" style=\"display:grid;gap:8px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,220px),1fr))\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"sjBId\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjBName\" placeholder=\"Bundle name (e.g. JIS show lot A)\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjBTotal\" type=\"number\" step=\"1\" placeholder=\"Total price $\"><input class=\"in\" id=\"sjBNote\" placeholder=\"Note shown to buyers (optional)\"><textarea class=\"in\" id=\"sjBIds\" rows=\"2\" style=\"grid-column:1/-1;height:auto;padding:8px\" placeholder=\"Stock numbers, comma or line separated\"></textarea><div style=\"grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><button class=\"b pri\" type=\"submit\">SAVE BUNDLE</button><button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-a=\"bclear\">CLEAR FORM</button></div></form>' +\n      (b.length ? '<div class=\"tw\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><table><tr><th>BUNDLE</th><th>STONES</th><th>LIST VALUE</th><th>BUNDLE PRICE</th><th>STATUS</th><th></th></tr>' + b.map(function (x) { return '<tr><td><b style=\"color:#261d3d\">' + esc(x.name) + '</b><br><span class=\"muted\">' + esc(x.note) + '</span></td><td>' + x.stones.map(function (st) { return '<span class=\"pill\" style=\"margin:1px;' + (st.inStock ? '' : 'border-color:#C8554F;color:#C8554F') + '\" title=\"' + esc(st.label) + '\">' + esc(st.id) + '</span>'; }).join(' ') + '</td><td>' + $(x.listSum) + '</td><td><b>' + $(x.total) + '</b><br><span class=\"muted\">' + (x.listSum ? Math.round((1 - x.total / x.listSum) * 100) + '% off list' : '') + '</span></td><td>' + (x.active ? (x.missing ? '<span style=\"color:#C8554F\">PARTIAL \u00b7 ' + x.missing + ' not available</span>' : '<span style=\"color:#2E8B57\">LIVE</span>') : '<span class=\"muted\">OFF</span>') + '</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><button class=\"b\" data-bedit=\"' + esc(x.id) + '\">EDIT</button> <button class=\"b\" data-btoggle=\"' + esc(x.id) + '\">' + (x.active ? 'TURN OFF' : 'TURN ON') + '</button> <button class=\"b danger\" data-bdel=\"' + esc(x.id) + '\">DELETE</button></td></tr>'; }).join('') + '</table></div>' : '<div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">No bundles yet.</div>') + '</div>';\n    h += jewelryCard();\n    h += '</div>';\n    return h;\n  }\n  function jewelryCard() {\n    var j = S.jewelry; if (!j) return '<div class=\"card\" style=\"grid-column:1/-1\"><h2>JEWELRY OFFERS</h2><div class=\"muted\">Loading\u2026</div></div>';\n    var N = j.names || { studs: 'Stud earrings \u00b7 per pair', bracelet: '7\u2033 tennis bracelets (14K gold)' };\n    var row = function (p, x) { return '<tr data-jrow=\"' + p + '|' + x.ctw + '\"' + (x.soldOut ? ' style=\"background:#F3F3F3\"' : '') + '><td><b style=\"color:#261d3d\">' + x.ctw + ' ct</b></td><td class=\"muted\">' + $(x.defPrice) + (x.defVol ? ' \u00b7 ' + $(x.defVol) + ' at 10+' : '') + '</td><td><input class=\"in\" data-jf=\"price\" type=\"number\" step=\"1\" value=\"' + x.price + '\" style=\"width:88px\" aria-label=\"' + x.ctw + ' ct price\"></td><td>' + (p === 'studs' ? '<input class=\"in\" data-jf=\"vol\" type=\"number\" step=\"1\" value=\"' + (x.vol || '') + '\" placeholder=\"\u2014\" style=\"width:84px\" aria-label=\"' + x.ctw + ' ct 10+ price\">' : '<span class=\"muted\">\u2014</span>') + '</td>' +\n      '<td><label style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-jf=\"so\"' + (x.soldOut ? ' checked' : '') + '> Sold out</label></td>' +\n      '<td>' + (x.soldOut ? '<span class=\"pill\" style=\"border-color:#6b6380;color:#6b6380\">SOLD OUT</span> ' : '') + (x.sale ? '<span class=\"pill\" style=\"border-color:#B8526D;color:#B8526D\">SALE \u00b7 was ' + $(x.defPrice) + '</span>' : x.custom ? '<span class=\"pill\">CUSTOM</span>' : (x.soldOut ? '' : '<span class=\"muted\">default</span>')) + '</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-jsave=\"' + p + '|' + x.ctw + '\">SAVE</button>' + (x.custom || x.soldOut ? ' <button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-jreset=\"' + p + '|' + x.ctw + '\">RESET</button>' : '') + '</td></tr>'; };\n    var block = function (p) { if (!j.table[p]) return ''; return '<div><h2 style=\"font-size:11px\">' + esc(String(N[p] || p).toUpperCase()) + '</h2><div class=\"tw\"><table><tr><th>SIZE</th><th>DEFAULT</th><th>PRICE</th><th>' + (p === 'studs' ? '10+ PAIRS' : '') + '</th><th></th><th></th><th></th></tr>' + j.table[p].map(function (x) { return row(p, x); }).join('') + '</table></div></div>'; };\n    return '<div class=\"card\" style=\"grid-column:1/-1\"><h2>JEWELRY OFFERS \u00b7 GOLD & SILVER</h2><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Set prices on the Jewelry Offers tab. Lower a price and the page shows the old price struck through with a SALE tag. Tick <b>Sold out</b> and that size shows a SOLD OUT band and can\u2019t be picked. The 10+ price is what a buyer pays per pair from 10 pairs of that size. Member discounts never apply to jewelry offers.</div>' +\n      '<div style=\"display:grid;gap:16px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,460px),1fr))\">' + ['studs', 'bracelet', 'sbr', 'snk', 'dbty'].map(block).join('') + '</div>' +\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-a=\"jreset\" ' + (S.busy ? 'disabled' : '') + '>RESET ALL TO DEFAULT PRICES</button></div></div>';\n  }\n  /* ---------- page designs: new Claude Design export \u2192 patched here in the browser \u2192 saved + published ---------- */\n  function srcOf(id) { var el = document.getElementById(id); return el ? el.textContent : ''; }\n  function pagesView() {\n    var p = S.pages, b = S.pageBuild; var h = S.opsMsg ? '<div class=\"note ' + (S.opsErr ? 'err' : 'ok') + '\">' + esc(S.opsMsg) + '</div>' : '';\n    h += '<div class=\"grid\">';\n    h += '<div class=\"card\"><h2>UPLOAD A NEW DESIGN</h2><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Export the page from Claude Design (standalone HTML) and drop it here. The Admin panel, live inventory, tracking and ordering hooks are added automatically \u2014 nothing in the Google Sheet is touched, so orders, customers and insights are never lost.</div>' +\n      (b ? '<div class=\"note ' + (b.ok ? 'ok' : 'err') + '\">' + esc(b.ok ? b.name + ' \u00b7 ready (' + b.kind + ' page, ' + Math.round(b.html.length / 1024) + ' KB)' : 'Could not prepare this file: ' + b.error) + '</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;max-height:260px;overflow:auto;border:1px solid #E6E1EC;padding:8px 10px;margin:8px 0\">' + b.report.map(function (x) { return '<div style=\"color:' + (x.ok ? '#2E8B57' : (x.core ? '#C8554F' : '#B8860B')) + '\">' + (x.ok ? '\u2713' : '\u2717') + ' ' + esc(x.label) + (x.note ? ' <span class=\"muted\">\u2014 ' + esc(x.note) + '</span>' : '') + '</div>'; }).join('') + '</div>' +\n        (b.ok ? '<div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><button class=\"b pri\" type=\"button\" data-a=\"pagesave\" ' + (S.busy ? 'disabled' : '') + '>SAVE AS ' + esc(b.name).toUpperCase() + '</button><button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-a=\"pagedl\">DOWNLOAD FILE</button><button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-a=\"pageclear\">DISCARD</button></div>' : '<button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-a=\"pageclear\">TRY ANOTHER FILE</button>') :\n        '<label class=\"drop\" id=\"sjPageDrop\"><b>Drop the Claude Design export here</b><span class=\"muted\">or click to choose the .html file. Diamonds (v7 with all three tabs), the gemstone page or the jewelry page \u2014 it recognises which one it is.</span><input type=\"file\" accept=\".html,text/html\" id=\"sjPageFile\" style=\"display:none\"></label>') + '</div>';\n    h += '<div class=\"card\"><h2>SITE FILES & PUBLISH</h2>' + (!p ? '<div class=\"muted\">Loading\u2026</div>' :\n      '<div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">These are the files that make up the live site. Publishing sends them to Netlify in one step.' + (p.netlify.lastDeploy ? ' Last published ' + esc(String(p.netlify.lastDeploy.when).slice(0, 16).replace('T', ' ')) + ' by ' + esc(p.netlify.lastDeploy.by) + '.' : '') + '</div>' +\n      (p.files.length ? '<table>' + p.files.map(function (f) { return '<tr><td><b style=\"color:#261d3d\">' + esc(f.name) + '</b><br><span class=\"muted\">' + Math.round(f.size / 1024) + ' KB \u00b7 ' + esc(f.updated) + '</span></td><td style=\"text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\"><button class=\"b\" type=\"button\" data-pagedl2=\"' + esc(f.nam